  "body": "Prepare to be mesmerized! This is arguably one of the most exceptional properties on the Peninsula, offering breathtaking, close two-way sea views that stretch from the horizon to the glittering city lights.\r\n\r\nCompletely renovated to the highest quality specifications, this contemporary cedar and brick home is ready for you to move in and start living the dream.\r\n\r\nDesigned for the View:\r\n\r\nTwo Levels of Luxury: Every main room captures the spectacular seascape.\r\n\r\nFlexible Layout: Three double bedrooms and two semi-ensuites.\r\n\r\nSeamless Entertaining: Generous formal dining room, lounge, and family area all flow easily to expansive decks on both sides of the house.\r\n\r\nPeace of Mind: Reassuring, low-maintenance cedar and brick construction.\r\n\r\nParking: Internal access double garage plus off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe Ultimate Location:\r\n\r\nWhile offering total seclusion, you're just a short walk from beautiful beaches, transport links, schools, and local shops.\r\n\r\nExperience coastal living elevated. Viewings are essential to truly appreciate this unique masterpiece. Call us today to view.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
